---
interface Props {
  compact?: boolean;
}

const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---

<figure class:list={["agent-loop", { compact }]}>
  <figcaption>
    <span>Agente = este ciclo en funcionamiento</span>
    <strong>Un objetivo avanza con decisiones, acciones y evidencia.</strong>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="harness-frame">
    <div class="harness-bar" role="group" aria-label="El harness sostiene el ciclo">
      <div>
        <span aria-hidden="true">⚙</span>
        <p><b>Harness</b><small>sostiene el ciclo · lo abrimos en la próxima parada</small></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="example" role="group" aria-label="Ejemplo que recorre el ciclo">
      <span>Ejemplo</span>
      <p>“Leé este PDF, encontrá tres riesgos y prepará un resumen.”</p>
    </div>

    <div class="loop-track" role="group" aria-label="Objetivo, propuesta del modelo, ejecución de una herramienta, evidencia y próxima decisión">
      <div class="loop-node objective">
        <span class="node-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</span>
        <b>Objetivo</b>
        <small>encontrar tres riesgos</small>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <div class="loop-node model">
        <span class="node-icon" aria-hidden="true">◇</span>
        <b>Modelo</b>
        <small>propone leer el PDF</small>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <div class="loop-node tool">
        <span class="node-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚙</span>
        <b>Tool</b>
        <small>abre el archivo</small>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <div class="loop-node evidence">
        <span class="node-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span>
        <b>Evidencia</b>
        <small>devuelve el contenido</small>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <div class="loop-node decision">
        <span class="node-icon" aria-hidden="true">?</span>
        <b>Decisión</b>
        <small>¿alcanza o hace falta seguir?</small>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="outcomes" role="group" aria-label="Posibles resultados de la decisión">
      <p class="repeat"><span aria-hidden="true">↺</span><b>Falta evidencia</b><small>El modelo propone el próximo paso.</small></p>
      <p class="finish"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><b>Objetivo cumplido</b><small>Entrega el resumen y termina.</small></p>
    </div>
  </div>

</figure>

<style>
  .agent-loop {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--violet, #6941a5) 28%, transparent);
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, color-mix(in srgb, #fff 88%, #ede9fe), color-mix(in srgb, #fff 92%, #dff5ee));
  }
  figcaption { display: grid; gap: .25rem; margin-bottom: 1.15rem; }
  figcaption span { color: var(--violet, #6941a5); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  figcaption strong { font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.35rem); }
  .harness-frame { overflow: hidden; border: 2px solid #20302b; border-radius: 1.35rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,.62); box-shadow: 4px 5px 0 rgba(32,48,43,.14); }
  .harness-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; padding: .75rem 1rem; background: #20302b; color: #fff; }
  .harness-bar > div { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; }
  .harness-bar > div > span { display: grid; width: 2.2rem; height: 2.2rem; place-items: center; border-radius: .65rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); }
  .harness-bar p { display: grid; gap: .05rem; margin: 0; }
  .harness-bar small { color: #dce5e1; font-size: .72rem; }
  .example { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: .65rem; margin: 1rem 1rem 0; padding: .7rem .85rem; border-left: 4px solid #d99a1e; border-radius: 0 .8rem .8rem 0; background: #fff7e5; }
  .example span { flex: none; color: #714c00; font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .example p { margin: 0; color: #394a44; font-weight: 750; }
  .loop-track { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr; gap: .4rem; align-items: stretch; padding: 1rem; }
  .loop-node { min-width: 0; min-height: 8.6rem; display: grid; place-items: center; align-content: center; gap: .25rem; padding: .85rem .55rem; border: 1px solid rgba(32,48,43,.15); border-radius: 1rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,.9); text-align: center; }
  .loop-node.objective { border-color: rgba(105,65,165,.38); }
  .loop-node.model { border-color: rgba(47,113,150,.38); }
  .loop-node.tool { border-color: rgba(217,154,30,.48); }
  .loop-node.evidence { border-color: rgba(23,107,85,.38); }
  .loop-node.decision { border-color: rgba(153,65,47,.38); }
  .node-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 2.25rem; height: 2.25rem; border-radius: .75rem; background: #f4f0ff; color: var(--violet, #6941a5); font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 900; }
  .loop-node small { max-width: 15ch; color: var(--muted, #51605a); line-height: 1.3; }
  .arrow { align-self: center; color: var(--violet, #6941a5); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 900; }
  .outcomes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: .65rem; padding: 0 1rem 1rem; }
  .outcomes p { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; column-gap: .55rem; align-items: center; margin: 0; padding: .7rem .8rem; border-radius: .9rem; }
  .outcomes p > span { grid-row: 1 / 3; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 900; }
  .outcomes small { color: #51605a; }
  .repeat { background: #fff4dc; color: #714c00; }
  .finish { background: #e1f3ea; color: #145c49; }
  .compact .loop-node { min-height: 7rem; }
  :global(body.is-presenting) .agent-loop { margin: .35rem 0; padding: .75rem; }
  :global(body.is-presenting) .agent-loop figcaption { margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  :global(body.is-presenting) .agent-loop .harness-bar { padding: .45rem .7rem; }
  :global(body.is-presenting) .agent-loop .example { margin: .5rem .7rem 0; padding: .45rem .65rem; }
  :global(body.is-presenting) .agent-loop .loop-track { padding: .55rem .7rem; }
  :global(body.is-presenting) .agent-loop .loop-node { min-height: 6.2rem; padding: .55rem .4rem; }
  :global(body.is-presenting) .agent-loop .outcomes { padding: 0 .7rem .55rem; }
  :global(body.is-presenting) .agent-loop .outcomes p { padding: .5rem .65rem; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .loop-track { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); text-align: center; }
    .loop-node { min-height: auto; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .harness-bar { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    .example { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: .2rem; }
    .outcomes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
